-CASE LatePropertiesAfterAggregate
-LOG Results equal base for every statement; EmptyDBTest.LatePropertyFetchConditions checks analogous shapes for which ones fetch late
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:person)-[:knows]->(b:person) MATCH (b)-[:studyAt]->(o:organisation) WITH b, count(*) AS c RETURN b.fName, b.age, c ORDER BY b.fName
